{
  "about": "The two Woods Map design-study scenarios (woods-map docs/design/design-study.md, section 3, Field Guide walkthroughs) as click-only paths over the blog scenario (woods-testbed#38). Each step clicks a link that must exist on the current page, outside the file-tree sheet, and checks where it lands. Read by scripts/woods_map_walk_smoke.rb (server-rendered HTML, the JavaScript-disabled path) and scripts/tools/woods_map_click_walk.mjs (a browser, JavaScript on and off, axe on every landing page).",
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "title": "Plan auto-tagging on posts",
      "requires": [
        [
          "Post",
          "model"
        ],
        [
          "PostsController",
          "controller"
        ],
        [
          "posts/show.html.erb",
          "view_template"
        ],
        [
          "posts/_card.html.erb",
          "view_template"
        ]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "step": "1",
          "start": "/woods",
          "h1": "gen"
        },
        {
          "step": "1",
          "click": "/woods/units",
          "h1": "Units"
        },
        {
          "step": "1",
          "click": "/woods/units/model/Post",
          "h1": "Post",
          "text": [
            "PostsController",
            "Comment"
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "1",
          "click": "/woods/units/model/Post/schema",
          "h1": "Post",
          "text": [
            "posts",
            "title"
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "2",
          "click": "/woods/units/controller/PostsController",
          "h1": "PostsController"
        },
        {
          "step": "2",
          "click": "/woods/units/controller/PostsController/passage",
          "h1": "PostsController#"
        },
        {
          "step": "2",
          "click": "/woods/units/controller/PostsController/passage?action_name=create",
          "h1": "PostsController#create",
          "text": [
            "Callback ladder",
            "after_commit",
            "NotifySubscribersJob"
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "3",
          "click": "/woods/units/controller/PostsController/routes",
          "h1": "PostsController",
          "text": [
            "post_path"
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "3",
          "click": "/woods/units/controller/PostsController/passage",
          "h1": "PostsController#",
          "text": [
            "set_post"
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "3",
          "click": "/woods/units/controller/PostsController",
          "h1": "PostsController",
          "text": [
            "post_params"
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "4",
          "click": "/woods/units/controller/PostsController/passage",
          "h1": "PostsController#"
        },
        {
          "step": "4",
          "click": "/woods/units/controller/PostsController/passage?action_name=show",
          "h1": "PostsController#show",
          "text": [
            "posts/show.html.erb",
            "posts/_card.html.erb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "4",
          "click": "/woods/units/view_template/posts/show.html.erb",
          "h1": "posts/show.html.erb",
          "text": [
            "@post"
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "4",
          "click": "/woods/units/view_template/posts/_card.html.erb",
          "h1": "posts/_card.html.erb"
        }
      ],
      "not_walked": [
        "step 2 goes through the controller's Passage, whose callback ladder shows after_commit -> NotifySubscribersJob: the Lifecycle tab on controllers draws only model event chains (woods-map#91)",
        "step 5 (\"Explain this model\") needs the guide (M7), which is disabled in the testbed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "title": "Mailing list job failing after post creation",
      "requires": [
        [
          "NotifySubscribersJob",
          "job"
        ],
        [
          "MailingListMailer",
          "mailer"
        ],
        [
          "mailing_list_mailer/new_post.html.erb",
          "view_template"
        ]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "step": "1",
          "start": "/woods",
          "h1": "gen"
        },
        {
          "step": "1",
          "click": "/woods/units",
          "h1": "Units"
        },
        {
          "step": "1",
          "click": "/woods/units/job/NotifySubscribersJob",
          "h1": "NotifySubscribersJob",
          "text": [
            "mailers",
            "Post",
            "MailingListMailer"
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "2",
          "click": "/woods/units/job/NotifySubscribersJob/lifecycle",
          "h1": "NotifySubscribersJob"
        },
        {
          "step": "3",
          "click": "/woods/units/job/NotifySubscribersJob/history",
          "h1": "NotifySubscribersJob"
        },
        {
          "step": "2",
          "click": "/woods/units/mailer/MailingListMailer",
          "h1": "MailingListMailer",
          "text": [
            "new_post"
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "3",
          "click": "/woods/units/mailer/MailingListMailer/history",
          "h1": "MailingListMailer"
        },
        {
          "step": "2",
          "click": "/woods/units/mailer/MailingListMailer/passage",
          "h1": "MailingListMailer#new_post",
          "text": [
            "@preferences"
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "2",
          "click": "/woods/units/view_template/mailing_list_mailer/new_post.html.erb",
          "h1": "mailing_list_mailer/new_post.html.erb",
          "text": [
            "@preferences"
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "4",
          "click_prefix": "/woods/history?author=",
          "optional": "the map has no author filter yet (woods-map#92), and a variant without .git publishes no commit table"
        }
      ],
      "not_walked": [
        "step 2 lands on the job's Lifecycle tab, which does not yet list perform's operations (woods-map#91); the walk continues to the mailer and its template"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
